{"unit":46,"section":2,"cefr":"A1","objective":"describe attributes","skill":"Adjectives 3","heading":"Describe attributes","phrases":[{"he":"מצאתי סוס נדיר.","en":"I found a rare horse.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/e2fd8cb2a95da08d7380eebb79394584","tokens":[{"w":"מצאתי","h":["I found"]},{"w":"סוס","h":["a horse","horse"]},{"w":"נדיר","h":["rare (sg. masc.)"]}]},{"he":"זאת חנות מקומית.","en":"It is a local shop.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/7ac6ddcec6edaa47622f35f2a7a8bcf8","tokens":[{"w":"זאת","h":["this is (feminine)","that is (feminine)","it is (feminine)"]},{"w":"חנות","h":["a shop","shop","store"]},{"w":"מקומית","h":["local (sg. fem.)"]}]},{"he":"אנחנו מחפשים את המבנה ההיסטורי.","en":"We are looking for the historic building.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/81110dbe0724783b6e4bdbfc49eeafd7","tokens":[{"w":"אנחנו","h":["we are","we"]},{"w":"מחפשים","h":["are looking for","look for","searching"]},{"w":"את","h":["you"]},{"w":"המבנה","h":["the building","the construction","the structure"]},{"w":"ההיסטורי","h":["historic","historical"]}]},{"he":"הכובע הזה מדהים!","en":"That hat is amazing.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/63d4b774a2b7504789e3ff07ba5c6706","tokens":[{"w":"הכובע","h":["the hat is","the hat"]},{"w":"הזה","h":["this","that"]},{"w":"מדהים","h":["amazing (sg. masc.)"]}]}],"words":[{"he":"מצאתי","en":"I found","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"סוס","en":"horse","alt":["a horse"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נדיר","en":"rare (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"חנות","en":"shop","alt":["a shop","store"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"מקומית","en":"local (sg. fem.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"מחפשים","en":"are looking for","alt":["look for","searching"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"המבנה","en":"the building","alt":["the construction","the structure"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ההיסטורי","en":"historic","alt":["historical"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"מדהים","en":"amazing (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"דתי","en":"religious (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"skill"},{"he":"הסופי","en":"the final (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"skill"},{"he":"זאת","en":"it is (feminine)","alt":["this is (feminine)","that is (feminine)"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"אנחנו","en":"we are","alt":["we"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"את","en":"you","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"הכובע","en":"the hat","alt":["the hat is"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"הזה","en":"that","alt":["this"],"from":"phrase"}],"lexemes":["זמינה","יומי","מרשימים","מרשימה","טהור","עבָה","טהורים","עבים","זמין","הבודד","בודדים","מיידית","ימני","רחב","המסורתית","תרבותיים","הדתי","מסורתי","דתי","שלם","תרבותי","חודשי","השבועית","החודשית","מטומטמת","התחתונה","צר","עמוקים","ההיסטורי","אישי","מטומטם","עמוק","העמוק","נדירים","סופי","נפלא","הסופי","פופולרי","נדירה","נפלאים","העתיק","סופית","נפלאה","עתיק","חד","נדיר","העליונה","שונֶה","שונים","פופולרית","העליון"],"tips":"**The adjective \"גרוע\"**\n\nThe adjective \"גרוע\" (garu'a - meaning \"bad\") is only used in terms of **quality**.\n\nFor example:\n\n> הסלט הזה גרוע - this salad is bad.\n\n(could be replaced with \"poor\", as in \"poor quality\")\n\nDon't confuse it with the adjective \"רע\" which is used in this sort of situation (could be replaced by \"evil\"):\n\n> הוא לא אדם רע - he is not a bad person."}